{"id":"42004383fb23d1fe","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-encoding.md","title":"Explicit polynomial-size encodings for Boolean representations","display":"df-encoding — Explicit polynomial-size encodings for Boolean representations","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-encoding","aliases":["27-df-encoding"],"display":"df-encoding — Explicit polynomial-size encodings for Boolean representations","depends_on":["[[27-df-literal]]","[[27-df-litset]]","[[27-df-clause]]","[[27-df-dnf]]","[[27-df-cnf]]","[[27-df-boolexpr]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§1.2 Definition 1.7; Appendix B.1, B.3","source_printed_pages":"12, 615–619","source_pdf_pages":"36, 639–643","verification_status":"local-explicit-encoding-of-source-input-convention","local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-encoding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-encoding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-encoding — Explicit polynomial-size encodings for Boolean representations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"99c92f3457aacd12\" href=\"?note=99c92f3457aacd12\" title=\"27-df-literal\">27-df-literal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"74438714e304bba9\" href=\"?note=74438714e304bba9\" title=\"27-df-clause\">27-df-clause</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6b749704e82fc727\" href=\"?note=6b749704e82fc727\" title=\"27-df-cnf\">27-df-cnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f3101a1c9df92f67\" href=\"?note=f3101a1c9df92f67\" title=\"27-df-boolexpr\">27-df-boolexpr</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§1.2 Definition 1.7; Appendix B.1, B.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"12, 615–619"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"36, 639–643"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-explicit-encoding-of-source-input-convention"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\">\\(D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_n\">\\(C\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"99c92f3457aacd12\" href=\"?note=99c92f3457aacd12\" title=\"27-df-literal\">27-df-literal</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"74438714e304bba9\" href=\"?note=74438714e304bba9\" title=\"27-df-clause\">27-df-clause</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"6b749704e82fc727\" href=\"?note=6b749704e82fc727\" title=\"27-df-cnf\">27-df-cnf</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"f3101a1c9df92f67\" href=\"?note=f3101a1c9df92f67\" title=\"27-df-boolexpr\">27-df-boolexpr</a>。字串以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[r]\">\\([r]\\)</span> 为定义域的函数编码；字串连接、有限列连接及字典序排序在 Assertion 中构造。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,F\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\">\\(E,F\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 表示满足给定条件的唯一对象。表面表达式的叶子和连接构造均采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"f3101a1c9df92f67\" href=\"?note=f3101a1c9df92f67\" title=\"27-df-boolexpr\">27-df-boolexpr</a> 的有限树语法。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lits}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lits}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CLits}\">\\(\\mathrm{CLits}\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"74438714e304bba9\" href=\"?note=74438714e304bba9\" title=\"27-df-clause\">27-df-clause</a>。局部递归函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\to\\mathbb B^*\">\\(s:\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\to\\mathbb B^*\\)</span> 的构造也由下式给出。定义目标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{encDNF},\\mathrm{encCNF},\\mathrm{encExpr},\\mathrm{pair}\">\\(\\mathrm{encDNF},\\mathrm{encCNF},\\mathrm{encExpr},\\mathrm{pair}\\)</span> 均为二进制字串编码函数符号；其合法输入与构造由下式固定。有限列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle b_1,\\ldots,b_r\\rangle\">\\(\\langle b_1,\\ldots,b_r\\rangle\\)</span> 也以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[r]\">\\([r]\\)</span> 为定义域；因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle0\\rangle\">\\(\\langle0\\rangle\\)</span> 是一位字串，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 是布尔值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u\\mathbin{\\Vert}v\\coloneqq\\{(i,u_i)\\mid i\\in[|u|]\\}\\cup\\{(|u|+j,v_j)\\mid j\\in[|v|]\\}\\quad(u,v\\in\\mathbb B^*).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u\\mathbin{\\Vert}v\\coloneqq\\{(i,u_i)\\mid i\\in[|u|]\\}\\cup\\{(|u|+j,v_j)\\mid j\\in[|v|]\\}\\quad(u,v\\in\\mathbb B^*).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"1^r\\coloneqq\\{(i,1)\\mid i\\in[r]\\}\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[1^r\\coloneqq\\{(i,1)\\mid i\\in[r]\\}\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{concat}(\\varnothing)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad\\operatorname{concat}(u_1,\\ldots,u_{r+1})\\coloneqq\\operatorname{concat}(u_1,\\ldots,u_r)\\mathbin{\\Vert}u_{r+1}\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N,\\ u_1,\\ldots,u_{r+1}\\in\\mathbb B^*).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{concat}(\\varnothing)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad\\operatorname{concat}(u_1,\\ldots,u_{r+1})\\coloneqq\\operatorname{concat}(u_1,\\ldots,u_r)\\mathbin{\\Vert}u_{r+1}\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N,\\ u_1,\\ldots,u_{r+1}\\in\\mathbb B^*).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}v\\Longleftrightarrow\\left(|u|&lt;|v|\\land\\forall i\\in[|u|]\\;(u_i=v_i)\\right)\\lor\\left(\\exists j\\in[\\min\\{|u|,|v|\\}]\\;(u_j&lt;v_j\\land\\forall i\\in[j-1]\\;(u_i=v_i))\\right)\\quad(u,v\\in\\mathbb B^*).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}v\\Longleftrightarrow\\left(|u|&lt;|v|\\land\\forall i\\in[|u|]\\;(u_i=v_i)\\right)\\lor\\left(\\exists j\\in[\\min\\{|u|,|v|\\}]\\;(u_j&lt;v_j\\land\\forall i\\in[j-1]\\;(u_i=v_i))\\right)\\quad(u,v\\in\\mathbb B^*).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sort}(K)\\coloneqq\\iota(u_1,\\ldots,u_k)\\in(\\mathbb B^*)^{[k]}\\;\\left(\\{u_i\\mid i\\in[k]\\}=K\\land\\forall i,j\\in[k]\\;(i&lt;j\\Rightarrow u_i&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}u_j)\\right)\\quad(K\\subseteq\\mathbb B^*,\\ |K|=k\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{sort}(K)\\coloneqq\\iota(u_1,\\ldots,u_k)\\in(\\mathbb B^*)^{[k]}\\;\\left(\\{u_i\\mid i\\in[k]\\}=K\\land\\forall i,j\\in[k]\\;(i&lt;j\\Rightarrow u_i&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}u_j)\\right)\\quad(K\\subseteq\\mathbb B^*,\\ |K|=k\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"r_{n,i}(L)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\langle0,0\\rangle&amp;x_i\\notin L\\land\\bar x_i\\notin L,\\\\\\langle0,1\\rangle&amp;x_i\\in L,\\\\\\langle1,0\\rangle&amp;\\bar x_i\\in L,\\end{cases}\\quad(i\\in[n]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[r_{n,i}(L)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\langle0,0\\rangle&amp;x_i\\notin L\\land\\bar x_i\\notin L,\\\\\\langle0,1\\rangle&amp;x_i\\in L,\\\\\\langle1,0\\rangle&amp;\\bar x_i\\in L,\\end{cases}\\quad(i\\in[n]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"r_n(L)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{concat}\\left((r_{n,i}(L))_{i\\in[n]}\\right),\\qquad r_0(\\varnothing)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[r_n(L)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{concat}\\left((r_{n,i}(L))_{i\\in[n]}\\right),\\qquad r_0(\\varnothing)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{encDNF}(n,D)\\coloneqq1^n\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\langle0\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}1^{|D|}\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\langle0\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\operatorname{concat}\\left(\\operatorname{sort}\\{r_n(\\mathrm{Lits}(T))\\mid T\\in D\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{encDNF}(n,D)\\coloneqq1^n\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\langle0\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}1^{|D|}\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\langle0\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\operatorname{concat}\\left(\\operatorname{sort}\\{r_n(\\mathrm{Lits}(T))\\mid T\\in D\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{encCNF}(n,C)\\coloneqq1^n\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\langle0\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}1^{|C|}\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\langle0\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\operatorname{concat}\\left(\\operatorname{sort}\\{r_n(\\mathrm{CLits}(K))\\mid K\\in C\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{encCNF}(n,C)\\coloneqq1^n\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\langle0\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}1^{|C|}\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\langle0\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\operatorname{concat}\\left(\\operatorname{sort}\\{r_n(\\mathrm{CLits}(K))\\mid K\\in C\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s(0)\\coloneqq\\langle0,0,0\\rangle,\\quad s(1)\\coloneqq\\langle0,0,1\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s(0)\\coloneqq\\langle0,0,0\\rangle,\\quad s(1)\\coloneqq\\langle0,0,1\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s(x_i)\\coloneqq\\langle0,1,1\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}1^i\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\langle0\\rangle,\\quad s(\\bar x_i)\\coloneqq\\langle0,1,0\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}1^i\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\langle0\\rangle\\quad(i\\in[n]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s(x_i)\\coloneqq\\langle0,1,1\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}1^i\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\langle0\\rangle,\\quad s(\\bar x_i)\\coloneqq\\langle0,1,0\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}1^i\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\langle0\\rangle\\quad(i\\in[n]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s(\\neg E)\\coloneqq\\langle1,0\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}s(E),\\quad s(E\\wedge F)\\coloneqq\\langle1,1,0\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}s(E)\\mathbin{\\Vert}s(F),\\quad s(E\\vee F)\\coloneqq\\langle1,1,1\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}s(E)\\mathbin{\\Vert}s(F),\\quad\\mathrm{encExpr}(n,E)\\coloneqq1^n\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\langle0\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}s(E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s(\\neg E)\\coloneqq\\langle1,0\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}s(E),\\quad s(E\\wedge F)\\coloneqq\\langle1,1,0\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}s(E)\\mathbin{\\Vert}s(F),\\quad s(E\\vee F)\\coloneqq\\langle1,1,1\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}s(E)\\mathbin{\\Vert}s(F),\\quad\\mathrm{encExpr}(n,E)\\coloneqq1^n\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\langle0\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}s(E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pair}(u,v)\\coloneqq1^{|u|}\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\langle0\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}u\\mathbin{\\Vert}v\\quad(u,v\\in\\mathbb B^*).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{pair}(u,v)\\coloneqq1^{|u|}\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\langle0\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}u\\mathbin{\\Vert}v\\quad(u,v\\in\\mathbb B^*).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>字典序是有限字串集上的严格全序；每个有限输入集合具有唯一递增列，因而排序中的唯一描述有定义。连接按有限列长度递归，包含空列。</p>\n<p>变量上界显式用 unary n 编码；项/子句各用 2n 位。空列表与零元列表均可唯一解析；非法编码一律是相应决策语言的 No-instance。式树编码的构造标签是前缀可解析码，长度与通常语法长度多项式等价。这是将原书编码/长度要求具体化的本地约定，不是原书逐字给出的码。DNF 与 CNF 码使用相同数据布局，但求值语义由语言名明确区分。坐标码使用双下标 r_{n,i}，总行码使用 r_n，避免 i=n 时两个构造重名；零元总行码明确为空字串。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-literal","status":"resolved","id":"99c92f3457aacd12","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-literal]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-litset","status":"resolved","id":"8311e93eaac6c631","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-litset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-clause","status":"resolved","id":"74438714e304bba9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-clause]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"6b749704e82fc727","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-cnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolexpr","status":"resolved","id":"f3101a1c9df92f67","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-boolexpr]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-literal","status":"resolved","id":"99c92f3457aacd12","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$L\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n$，$D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n$，$C\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_n$；见 [[27-df-literal]]、[[27-df-litset]]、[[27-