F}_n$；见 [[27-df-literal]]、[[27-df-litset]]、[[27-df-clause]]、[[27-df-dnf]]、[[27-df-cnf]]、[[27-df-boolexpr]]。字串以 $[r]$ 为定义域的函数编码；字串连接、有限列连接及字典序排序在 Assertion 中构造。$E,F\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n$；$\\iota$ 表示满足给定条件的唯一对象。表面表达式的叶子和连接构造均采用 [[27-df-boolexpr]] 的有限树语法。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolexpr","status":"resolved","id":"f3101a1c9df92f67","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$L\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n$，$D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n$，$C\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_n$；见 [[27-df-literal]]、[[27-df-litset]]、[[27-df-clause]]、[[27-df-dnf]]、[[27-df-cnf]]、[[27-df-boolexpr]]。字串以 $[r]$ 为定义域的函数编码；字串连接、有限列连接及字典序排序在 Assertion 中构造。$E,F\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n$；$\\iota$ 表示满足给定条件的唯一对象。表面表达式的叶子和连接构造均采用 [[27-df-boolexpr]] 的有限树语法。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolexpr","status":"resolved","id":"f3101a1c9df92f67","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$L\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n$，$D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n$，$C\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_n$；见 [[27-df-literal]]、[[27-df-litset]]、[[27-df-clause]]、[[27-df-dnf]]、[[27-df-cnf]]、[[27-df-boolexpr]]。字串以 $[r]$ 为定义域的函数编码；字串连接、有限列连接及字典序排序在 Assertion 中构造。$E,F\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n$；$\\iota$ 表示满足给定条件的唯一对象。表面表达式的叶子和连接构造均采用 [[27-df-boolexpr]] 的有限树语法。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-litset","status":"resolved","id":"8311e93eaac6c631","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Lits}$ 与 $\\mathrm{CLits}$ 分别见 [[27-df-litset]]、[[27-df-clause]]。局部递归函数 $s:\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\to\\mathbb B^*$ 的构造也由下式给出。定义目标 $\\mathrm{encDNF},\\mathrm{encCNF},\\mathrm{encExpr},\\mathrm{pair}$ 均为二进制字串编码函数符号；其合法输入与构造由下式固定。有限列 $\\langle b_1,\\ldots,b_r\\rangle$ 也以 $[r]$ 为定义域；因此 $\\langle0\\rangle$ 是一位字串，$0$ 是布尔值。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-clause","status":"resolved","id":"74438714e304bba9","anchor":"ref-15","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Lits}$ 与 $\\mathrm{CLits}$ 分别见 [[27-df-litset]]、[[27-df-clause]]。局部递归函数 $s:\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\to\\mathbb B^*$ 的构造也由下式给出。定义目标 $\\mathrm{encDNF},\\mathrm{encCNF},\\mathrm{encExpr},\\mathrm{pair}$ 均为二进制字串编码函数符号；其合法输入与构造由下式固定。有限列 $\\langle b_1,\\ldots,b_r\\rangle$ 也以 $[r]$ 为定义域；因此 $\\langle0\\rangle$ 是一位字串，$0$ 是布尔值。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"[r]","display":false},{"tex":"E,F\\in\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lits}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CLits}","display":false},{"tex":"s:\\mathrm{BoolExpr}_n\\to\\mathbb B^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{encDNF},\\mathrm{encCNF},\\mathrm{encExpr},\\mathrm{pair}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle b_1,\\ldots,b_r\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"[r]","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle0\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"u\\mathbin{\\Vert}v\\coloneqq\\{(i,u_i)\\mid i\\in[|u|]\\}\\cup\\{(|u|+j,v_j)\\mid j\\in[|v|]\\}\\quad(u,v\\in\\mathbb B^*).","display":true},{"tex":"1^r\\coloneqq\\{(i,1)\\mid i\\in[r]\\}\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{concat}(\\varnothing)\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad\\operatorname{concat}(u_1,\\ldots,u_{r+1})\\coloneqq\\operatorname{concat}(u_1,\\ldots,u_r)\\mathbin{\\Vert}u_{r+1}\\quad(r\\in\\mathbb N,\\ u_1,\\ldots,u_{r+1}\\in\\mathbb B^*).","display":true},{"tex":"u<_{\\mathrm{lex}}v\\Longleftrightarrow\\left(|u|<|v|\\land\\forall i\\in[|u|]\\;(u_i=v_i)\\right)\\lor\\left(\\exists j\\in[\\min\\{|u|,|v|\\}]\\;(u_j<v_j\\land\\forall i\\in[j-1]\\;(u_i=v_i))\\right)\\quad(u,v\\in\\mathbb B^*).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sort}(K)\\coloneqq\\iota(u_1,\\ldots,u_k)\\in(\\mathbb B^*)^{[k]}\\;\\left(\\{u_i\\mid i\\in[k]\\}=K\\land\\forall i,j\\in[k]\\;(i<j\\Rightarrow u_i<_{\\mathrm{lex}}u_j)\\right)\\quad(K\\subseteq\\mathbb B^*,\\ |K|=k\\in\\mathbb N).","display":true},{"tex":"r_{n,i}(L)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\langle0,0\\rangle&x_i\\notin L\\land\\bar x_i\\notin L,\\\\\\langle0,1\\rangle&x_i\\in L,\\\\\\langle1,0\\rangle&\\bar x_i\\in L,\\end{cases}\\quad(i\\in[n]).","display":true},{"tex":"r_n(L)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{concat}\\left((r_{n,i}(L))_{i\\in[n]}\\right),\\qquad r_0(\\varnothing)=\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{encDNF}(n,D)\\coloneqq1^n\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\langle0\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}1^{|D|}\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\langle0\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\operatorname{concat}\\left(\\operatorname{sort}\\{r_n(\\mathrm{Lits}(T))\\mid T\\in D\\}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{encCNF}(n,C)\\coloneqq1^n\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\langle0\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}1^{|C|}\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\langle0\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\operatorname{concat}\\left(\\operatorname{sort}\\{r_n(\\mathrm{CLits}(K))\\mid K\\in C\\}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"s(0)\\coloneqq\\langle0,0,0\\rangle,\\quad s(1)\\coloneqq\\langle0,0,1\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"s(x_i)\\coloneqq\\langle0,1,1\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}1^i\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\langle0\\rangle,\\quad s(\\bar x_i)\\coloneqq\\langle0,1,0\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}1^i\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\langle0\\rangle\\quad(i\\in[n]).","display":true},{"tex":"s(\\neg E)\\coloneqq\\langle1,0\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}s(E),\\quad s(E\\wedge F)\\coloneqq\\langle1,1,0\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}s(E)\\mathbin{\\Vert}s(F),\\quad s(E\\vee F)\\coloneqq\\langle1,1,1\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}s(E)\\mathbin{\\Vert}s(F),\\quad\\mathrm{encExpr}(n,E)\\coloneqq1^n\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\langle0\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}s(E).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{pair}(u,v)\\coloneqq1^{|u|}\\mathbin{\\Vert}\\langle0\\rangle\\mathbin{\\Vert}u\\mathbin{\\Vert}v\\quad(u,v\\in\\mathbb B^*).","display":true}],"bytes":5024,"backlinks":[{"id":"f8a4092aca6c1520","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}$、$\\mathrm{A